From 79ca7e64a9ef85da88ce684e0d275354886b20a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:18:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] chore: pin the toolchain to 1.99.0 and raise rust-version
 to 1.99

One toolchain builds Vector and lance-graph into one binary; lance-graph
and ndarray pin 1.99.0. vector-core and enrichment check clean on 1.99.0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XAqKMQ4AAwGSJUSyipw8gD
---
 Cargo.lock          | 115 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 Cargo.toml          |   2 +-
 rust-toolchain.toml |   2 +-
 3 files changed, 115 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

